{"seq":1,"slug":"creation-redemption","title":"申购赎回机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/etf-mechanics/creation-redemption","wordCount":2009,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"申购赎回机制\">申购赎回机制</h1><blockquote>\n<p>AP（授权参与人）角色、实物申赎流程、折溢价套利、与共同基金的结构性差异。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ETF 的效率来自一个把&quot;份额的创造&quot;与&quot;份额的交易&quot;解耦的双重结构：一级市场只有 AP 能用一篮子股票实物申赎份额，二级市场才是普通投资者买卖的场所。实物申赎是整台机器的关节——赎回时投资者拿走的是股票而非现金，基金因此不必被迫卖出持仓、不触发资本利得、也不会把冲击成本转嫁给其他持有人。AP 在两层之间套利，当市价偏离净值超出申赎与交易成本构成的&quot;无套利区间&quot;时自动把价格锚回净值，IOPV 则为套利提供每 15 秒更新的实时信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"etf-的双重交易结构\">ETF 的双重交易结构</h2><p>ETF 区别于传统共同基金的核心特征是其<strong>双重交易结构</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>一级市场</strong>：AP 与基金公司之间的申购赎回（Creation/Redemption）</li>\n<li><strong>二级市场</strong>：普通投资者在交易所的买卖</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 一级市场&#10;        AP[授权参与人 AP] --&gt;|递交一篮子股票| FM[基金管理人]&#10;        FM --&gt;|发行 ETF 份额| AP&#10;        AP --&gt;|退回 ETF 份额| FM&#10;        FM --&gt;|退还一篮子股票| AP&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 二级市场&#10;        INV1[投资者 A] --&gt;|买入 ETF| EX[交易所]&#10;        INV2[投资者 B] --&gt;|卖出 ETF| EX&#10;        AP --&gt;|做市/套利| EX&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 一级市场\n        AP[授权参与人 AP] --&gt;|递交一篮子股票| FM[基金管理人]\n        FM --&gt;|发行 ETF 份额| AP\n        AP --&gt;|退回 ETF 份额| FM\n        FM --&gt;|退还一篮子股票| AP\n    end\n    subgraph 二级市场\n        INV1[投资者 A] --&gt;|买入 ETF| EX[交易所]\n        INV2[投资者 B] --&gt;|卖出 ETF| EX\n        AP --&gt;|做市/套利| EX\n    end</pre><p>这种双层结构是 ETF 效率优势的基础——它将&quot;基金份额的创造与销毁&quot;和&quot;基金份额的交易&quot;解耦，让每一层都能独立优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"授权参与人-ap-的角色\">授权参与人（AP）的角色</h2><p>AP 是 ETF 生态系统的关键节点。它们是经过基金公司授权、可以直接参与一级市场申赎的大型金融机构（通常是券商或做市商）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ap-的资质要求-中国市场\">AP 的资质要求（中国市场）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要求</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>机构类型</td>\n<td>证券公司、基金公司自营</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资本金</td>\n<td>通常要求净资本 ≥10 亿元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权协议</td>\n<td>与基金管理人签署参与人协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术能力</td>\n<td>实时 PCF 清单处理、篮子交易系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规要求</td>\n<td>满足交易所和基金公司的风控标准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在中国市场，华泰证券、中信证券、中金公司等头部券商是主要的 ETF AP。2026 年，随着 ETF 市场规模突破 5 万亿元，AP 数量和竞争程度显著提升。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ap-的经济动机\">AP 的经济动机</h3><p>AP 参与 ETF 申赎不是&quot;义务劳动&quot;——它们的经济激励来自：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>折溢价套利</strong>：当 ETF 市价偏离净值时赚取差价</li>\n<li><strong>做市价差</strong>：在二级市场提供双边报价赚取买卖价差</li>\n<li><strong>大宗交易佣金</strong>：为机构客户执行大额 ETF 交易收取手续费</li>\n<li><strong>存货管理</strong>：利用 ETF 机制管理自营股票头寸</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"实物申赎流程\">实物申赎流程</h2><h3 id=\"申购流程-creation\">申购流程（Creation）</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant AP as 授权参与人&#10;    participant FM as 基金管理人&#10;    participant EX as 交易所&#10;    participant CSD as 中国结算&#10;&#10;    FM-&gt;&gt;EX: T-1日发布 PCF 清单&#10;    Note over FM,EX: PCF=组合证券清单&lt;br/&gt;含现金替代标志&#10;    AP-&gt;&gt;EX: T日提交申购指令&#10;    AP-&gt;&gt;CSD: 冻结一篮子股票&#10;    CSD-&gt;&gt;FM: 确认证券已冻结&#10;    FM-&gt;&gt;CSD: T+1日确认申购&#10;    CSD-&gt;&gt;AP: T+2日ETF份额到账&#10;    Note over AP: 新ETF份额可在&lt;br/&gt;二级市场卖出\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant AP as 授权参与人\n    participant FM as 基金管理人\n    participant EX as 交易所\n    participant CSD as 中国结算\n\n    FM-&gt;&gt;EX: T-1日发布 PCF 清单\n    Note over FM,EX: PCF=组合证券清单&lt;br/&gt;含现金替代标志\n    AP-&gt;&gt;EX: T日提交申购指令\n    AP-&gt;&gt;CSD: 冻结一篮子股票\n    CSD-&gt;&gt;FM: 确认证券已冻结\n    FM-&gt;&gt;CSD: T+1日确认申购\n    CSD-&gt;&gt;AP: T+2日ETF份额到账\n    Note over AP: 新ETF份额可在&lt;br/&gt;二级市场卖出</pre><h3 id=\"pcf-清单-portfolio-composition-file\">PCF 清单（Portfolio Composition File）</h3><p>每日开市前，基金管理人公布 PCF 清单，详细列出申购一个最小申赎单位（通常为 50 万份或 100 万份）所需的：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成部分</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成分股清单</td>\n<td>每只股票的名称、代码和所需数量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现金替代标识</td>\n<td>标注哪些成分股允许/必须/禁止现金替代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现金差额</td>\n<td>零碎股数或停牌股的现金替代金额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预估现金</td>\n<td>申购时需额外支付的现金金额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"现金替代机制\">现金替代机制</h3><p>在实物申赎中，并非所有成分股都能/都需要实物交割：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>替代类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>禁止替代</td>\n<td>必须以实物交割</td>\n<td>正常交易的成分股</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>允许替代</td>\n<td>AP 可选择实物或现金</td>\n<td>流动性较好的成分股</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>必须替代</td>\n<td>只能以现金替代</td>\n<td>停牌股、限售股</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退补现金</td>\n<td>申赎后根据实际成交补退差额</td>\n<td>允许替代的成分股</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"赎回流程-redemption\">赎回流程（Redemption）</h3><p>赎回是申购的逆过程：AP 将 ETF 份额退回给基金公司，换回一篮子股票。</p>\n<p><strong>关键特征</strong>：赎回得到的是<strong>股票而非现金</strong>。这意味着：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基金不需要卖出股票筹集现金</li>\n<li>不触发资本利得（至少在美国税法下）</li>\n<li>基金的投资组合不会因赎回而被迫调仓</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"折溢价套利机制\">折溢价套利机制</h2><p>ETF 价格之所以能紧密跟踪净值，依赖于 AP 的套利行为：</p>\n<h3 id=\"溢价套利-premium-arbitrage\">溢价套利（Premium Arbitrage）</h3><p>当 ETF 市价 &gt; 净值（IOPV）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>AP 在股票市场买入一篮子成分股</li>\n<li>AP 将成分股递交给基金公司，申购 ETF 份额</li>\n<li>AP 在二级市场卖出 ETF 份额</li>\n<li>赚取差价（扣除成本后）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>效果</strong>：增加 ETF 供给 → ETF 价格下降 → 折溢价收窄</p>\n<h3 id=\"折价套利-discount-arbitrage\">折价套利（Discount Arbitrage）</h3><p>当 ETF 市价 &lt; 净值（IOPV）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>AP 在二级市场买入 ETF 份额</li>\n<li>AP 将 ETF 份额递交给基金公司，赎回一篮子成分股</li>\n<li>AP 在股票市场卖出成分股</li>\n<li>赚取差价（扣除成本后）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>效果</strong>：减少 ETF 供给 → ETF 价格上升 → 折溢价收窄</p>\n<h3 id=\"套利边界\">套利边界</h3><p>套利并非无成本的——存在一个&quot;无套利区间&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|P_{ETF} - NAV| \\leq C_{creation} + C_{trading} + C_{risk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{creation}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：申赎手续费</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{trading}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：股票交易成本（价差 + 冲击 + 佣金）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{risk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：执行时间内的价格风险</li>\n</ul>\n<p>中国市场典型的无套利区间约为 ±0.1%–0.3%（大盘 ETF）至 ±0.5%–1.0%（跨境/商品 ETF）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与共同基金的结构性差异\">与共同基金的结构性差异</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>ETF</th>\n<th>开放式共同基金</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交易方式</td>\n<td>交易所实时买卖</td>\n<td>每日一次按净值申赎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定价频率</td>\n<td>每秒（市场价格）</td>\n<td>每日一次（收盘净值）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小投资单位</td>\n<td>1 份（几百元）</td>\n<td>通常 10 元起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>申赎机制</td>\n<td>实物申赎（AP 专属）</td>\n<td>现金申赎（所有投资者）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>透明度</td>\n<td>每日公布完整持仓（PCF）</td>\n<td>季度公布前十大持仓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>赎回压力</td>\n<td>不影响其他投资者</td>\n<td>被迫卖股影响所有持有人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易成本</td>\n<td>佣金 + 价差</td>\n<td>申购费 + 赎回费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税务效率</td>\n<td>高（实物赎回不触发利得）</td>\n<td>低（现金赎回需卖出证券）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"赎回踩踏问题\">赎回踩踏问题</h3><p>共同基金的致命缺陷之一是<strong>赎回踩踏</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[市场下跌] --&gt; B[投资者恐慌赎回]&#10;    B --&gt; C[基金被迫卖出股票筹集现金]&#10;    C --&gt; D[卖出压力加剧下跌]&#10;    D --&gt; A&#10;    C --&gt; E[剩余持有人承担冲击成本]\">graph TD\n    A[市场下跌] --&gt; B[投资者恐慌赎回]\n    B --&gt; C[基金被迫卖出股票筹集现金]\n    C --&gt; D[卖出压力加剧下跌]\n    D --&gt; A\n    C --&gt; E[剩余持有人承担冲击成本]</pre><p>ETF 的实物赎回机制天然规避了这一问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>赎回者拿走的是股票，基金不需要变现</li>\n<li>其他投资者的持仓不受影响</li>\n<li>基金经理不会被迫在不利时机卖出</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"中国-etf-申赎实务\">中国 ETF 申赎实务</h2><h3 id=\"最小申赎单位\">最小申赎单位</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>ETF 类型</th>\n<th>典型最小申赎单位</th>\n<th>最低门槛（估算）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>宽基股票 ETF</td>\n<td>50 万份</td>\n<td>~150 万元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行业主题 ETF</td>\n<td>50-100 万份</td>\n<td>~50-200 万元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨境 ETF</td>\n<td>100 万份</td>\n<td>~100 万元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>债券 ETF</td>\n<td>50 万份</td>\n<td>~50 万元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>货币 ETF</td>\n<td>100 万份</td>\n<td>~100 万元</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"t-n-规则\">T+N 规则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>中国 A 股 ETF</th>\n<th>跨境 ETF</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>买入后卖出</td>\n<td>T+1</td>\n<td>T+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买入后赎回</td>\n<td>T+0（当日可赎）</td>\n<td>T+0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>申购后卖出</td>\n<td>T+2</td>\n<td>T+2 或 T+3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>赎回后资金到账</td>\n<td>T+1 或 T+2</td>\n<td>T+2 至 T+5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2026 年 4 月新规将 ETF 申赎纳入短线交易豁免范围，解决了保险、社保等大型机构的操作限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"iopv-etf-的实时-gps\">IOPV：ETF 的实时&quot;GPS&quot;</h2><p>IOPV（Indicative Optimized Portfolio Value，基金份额参考净值）是交易所每 15 秒发布的 ETF 实时估算净值。它的计算方式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>现金余额</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>F</mi><mtext>总份额</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">IOPV = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{N} P_i \\times Q_i + \\text{现金余额}}{ETF\\text{总份额}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3569em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6709em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总份额</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">现金余额</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是成分股最新成交价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是每份 ETF 对应的成分股数量。</p>\n<p>IOPV 的作用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>为投资者提供实时公允价值参考</li>\n<li>为套利者提供折溢价信号</li>\n<li>为做市商提供报价基准</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>关键洞见</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>双重结构</td>\n<td>一级市场（AP 申赎）+ 二级市场（投资者交易）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AP 角色</td>\n<td>套利者 + 做市商 + ETF 供需调节者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实物申赎</td>\n<td>以股票换份额，避免现金交易引发的税务和冲击</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>套利机制</td>\n<td>折溢价超出成本边界时自动触发，锚定价格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>赎回优势</td>\n<td>ETF 赎回不影响其他投资者，避免踩踏效应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IOPV</td>\n<td>每 15 秒更新的实时净值估算，套利的&quot;信号灯&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"申购赎回机制","id":"申购赎回机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ETF 的双重交易结构","id":"etf-的双重交易结构"},{"level":2,"text":"授权参与人（AP）的角色","id":"授权参与人-ap-的角色"},{"level":3,"text":"AP 的资质要求（中国市场）","id":"ap-的资质要求-中国市场"},{"level":3,"text":"AP 的经济动机","id":"ap-的经济动机"},{"level":2,"text":"实物申赎流程","id":"实物申赎流程"},{"level":3,"text":"申购流程（Creation）","id":"申购流程-creation"},{"level":3,"text":"PCF 清单（Portfolio Composition File）","id":"pcf-清单-portfolio-composition-file"},{"level":3,"text":"现金替代机制","id":"现金替代机制"},{"level":3,"text":"赎回流程（Redemption）","id":"赎回流程-redemption"},{"level":2,"text":"折溢价套利机制","id":"折溢价套利机制"},{"level":3,"text":"溢价套利（Premium Arbitrage）","id":"溢价套利-premium-arbitrage"},{"level":3,"text":"折价套利（Discount Arbitrage）","id":"折价套利-discount-arbitrage"},{"level":3,"text":"套利边界","id":"套利边界"},{"level":2,"text":"与共同基金的结构性差异","id":"与共同基金的结构性差异"},{"level":3,"text":"赎回踩踏问题","id":"赎回踩踏问题"},{"level":2,"text":"中国 ETF 申赎实务","id":"中国-etf-申赎实务"},{"level":3,"text":"最小申赎单位","id":"最小申赎单位"},{"level":3,"text":"T+N 规则","id":"t-n-规则"},{"level":2,"text":"IOPV：ETF 的实时\"GPS\"","id":"iopv-etf-的实时-gps"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跟踪误差与基金评价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/index-fund-theory/tracking-error"},"next":{"title":"做市商与流动性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/etf-mechanics/market-making"}}